<para>
  <classname>ThreeVectorFieldInit</classname> objects are used as the
  <varname>initializer</varname> argument in the <xref
  linkend="MenuItem-OOF.Mesh.Set_Field_Initializer"/> command when
  assigning initial values to a three-component field on a &mesh;,
  such as the <link
  linkend="Section-Concepts-Mesh-3D">out-of-plane</link> parts of the
  displacement &field;.
</para>


